<title>UK: UK's JBA Holdings to place 1.7 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>UK's JBA Holdings to place 1.7 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British software and applications firm JBA Holdings Plc said on Wednesday it was planning to place 1.7 million shares, representing about five percent of its existing share capital, with institutional investors.</p>
<p>The company said the money would be used to repay borrowings of 5.6 million stg incurred in April 1997 when it acquired French firm Presys Holding S.A. and proceed with further expansion.</p>
<p>The company said it would announce the details of the issue later.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
